  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">People-Centered AMR Research and Innovation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Grant forms one of two parts of the joint delivery approach for the People-Centred Caribbean AMR Research and Innovation project to be delivered by ICARS and IDRC. The project is delivered in parallel with DHSCfunded project activity to strengthen Caribbean AMR surveillance systems and data use. Together,  these represent a comprehensive effort to partner with Caribbean institutions and Member States to  transform the regional response to AMR and mitigate its impact.</narrative>
  </description>
